  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/a9cf643aeeb167b9891ad54dedfeedec58ed8e93</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/0xzerolight/anki_miner/commit/a9cf643aeeb167b9891ad54dedfeedec58ed8e93"/>
    <title>
        fix(packs): make the spaCy languages load in frozen builds
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-14T19:09:56Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205416739?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>0xzerolight</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/0xzerolight</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix(packs): make the spaCy languages load in frozen builds

- every spaCy language failed at import in all four frozen builds: spaCy is excluded, so stdlib modules only it imports (timeit, cProfile, pstats, zoneinfo) never entered the graph; pinned as hiddenimports
- the _spacy pack subtracted every requirements.lock pin, but the lock also pins the [asr] extra&amp;#39;s closure, which the bundle excludes; weasel imports typer and httpx at `import spacy`
- pin_language_pack.py now subtracts only lock pins the base install resolves to; regenerated _spacy adds typer, shellingham, annotated-doc, httpx, httpcore, h11, anyio (lock versions, nothing else moved)
- typer/shellingham/annotated_doc join the spaCy excludes; the &amp;quot;huggingface_hub bundles typer&amp;quot; exception went stale when hf moved to the ASR pack&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
