    <title>
        fix(curator): play a parked preview from the line&#39;s start
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-13T20:10:38Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205416739?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>0xzerolight</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/0xzerolight</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix(curator): play a parked preview from the line&amp;#39;s start

- 1f7f0f71 parks the preview on the screenshot frame (line start +
  screenshot_offset, 1.0 s by default); Play unpaused there, so the
  first second of every line went unheard
- SubtitlePlayerWidget.set_play_from: next Play seeks to the origin;
  a seek, frame step or new source voids it, Play consumes it&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
